{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Brings.BringDescendingTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Brings.BringDescendingTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.genus_two_unramified_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.genus_two_unramified_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L110-L115","doc":"**The descending tower stops at genus 2**: an unramified degree-`d` cover from genus 2\nonto genus `h'` satisfies `2·2 − 2 = d (2h' − 2)`, forcing `d = 1`. Stated as\n`1 = d * (h' - 1)` with `h' ≥ 2` (a genus-0 or genus-1 target is excluded by the sign/value of\nthe Euler characteristic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.free_quotient_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.free_quotient_genus","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L106-L108","doc":"**Riemann–Hurwitz for a free `C₃` quotient of a genus-4 curve**: `2·4 − 2 = 3(2h − 2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.fourCycle_fixed_point","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.fourCycle_fixed_point","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L96-L100","doc":"**4-cycle `(1234)`**: `(1, i, −1, −i, 0)` is a fixed point on the curve. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.doubleTransposition_fixed_point","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.doubleTransposition_fixed_point","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L90-L94","doc":"**Double transposition `(12)(34)`**: `(1, −1, i, −i, 0)` is a fixed point on the curve. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.transposition_fixed_point","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.transposition_fixed_point","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L79-L88","doc":"**Transposition `(45)`**: with `r₁, r₂, r₃` the roots of `t³ + 2t² + 3t + 4`,\n`(r₁, r₂, r₃, 1, 1)` lies on Bring's curve and is fixed by `(45)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.threeCycle_eigenω_off_curve","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.threeCycle_eigenω_off_curve","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L69-L77","doc":"**3-cycle, `ω`- and `ω²`-eigenspaces**: `s(1, ω, ω²)` has cubic sum `3s³`, nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.threeCycle_eigen1_free","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.DescendingTower.threeCycle_eigen1_free","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringDescendingTower.lean#L46-L67","doc":"**3-cycle, `+1` eigenspace**: the point `(a,a,a,x,y)` lies on Bring's curve only if it is\nzero. Needs `30 ≠ 0` (characteristic not 2, 3, 5). ","signatureChunk":0}]}